  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the MESPI in implementing MRVA and Enhancing Climate Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201c;Supporting the Climate Change and Green Agenda in Implementing MRVA and Enhancing Climate Resilience&#x201d; project is dedicated to advancing decarbonization efforts and climate action in Kosovo by working towards the operationalization of the respective system for monitoring, reporting and verifying greenhouse gas emissions (MRVA), as well as enhancing legislation and technical capacities on Kosovo institution level with respect to the promotion of renewable energy sources (RES) and the climate</narrative>
  </description>
